<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>fishing</Major>
    <Description>This is a fully automatic bot for fishing in GTA rp. Just assign the fishing rod to the J key, select a convenient key to activate and go fishing. Don't forget to set the latest macro mode. And one more moment, when the bot starts to leave for the farm, point the cursor at the icon of the left mouse button, which is already highlighted with a red scale, shows the process of casting a fishing rod and chewing. When the stock is full, we take everything into the car and just restart the bot on the button that you set</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
